SUMMARY:NetSec Training School
DESCRIPTION:Training and mentoring for early-career researchers in European security\, run by NetSec and the European Initiative for Security Studies at the University of Belgrade\, Faculty of Political Science\, alongside the European Security Studies Conference. Details of the school and the call for applications will follow.\n\nFull details: https://netsec-cost.eu/summer-school.html
